hpc:Host a owl:Class .
hpc:DockerImage rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Host ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:order rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Host .

hpc:LSB_ECHKPNT_METHOD rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Host ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    hpc:LsbEchkpntMethod rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Environmentvariable .

hpc:LSB_ECHKPNT_METHOD_DIR rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Host ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    hpc:LsbEchkpntMethodDir rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Environmentvariable .

hpc:LSB_ECHKPNT_KEEP_OUTPUT rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Host ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    hpc:LsbEchkpntKeepOutput rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Environmentvariable .

hpc:LSB_EFFECTIVE_RSRCREQ rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string ;
    hpc:LsbEffectiveRsrcreq rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Resourcerequirement .

hpc:LSB_ERESTART_USRCMD rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .


In this ontology fragment, we have defined classes for `Host` and `Job`, and datatype properties for various parameters such as `DockerImage`, `order`, `LSB_ECHKPNT_METHOD`, `LSB_ECHKPNT_METHOD_DIR`, `LSB_ECHKPNT_KEEP_OUTPUT`, `LSB_EFFECTIVE_RSRCREQ`, and `LSB_ERESTART_USRCMD`. We have also defined a subclass relationship between `LSB_ECHKPNT_METHOD`, `LSB_ECHKPNT_METHOD_DIR`, and `LSB_ECHKPNT_KEEP_OUTPUT` and the superclass `EnvironmentVariable`. Additionally, we have defined the domain and range for each property.
